    <item>
      <title>奇经八脉</title>
      <link>http://localhost:62317/posts/zhenjiu-5-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 10:10:00 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:62317/posts/zhenjiu-5-2/</guid>
      <category domain="http://localhost:62317/categories/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">针灸笔记</category>
      <description>奇经八脉（督脉、任脉、冲脉、带脉、阳蹻脉、阴蹻脉、阳维脉、阴维脉）是十二正经的补充系统，分别调节阳气、阴血、气血运行、腰腹约束及肢体运动，通过特定穴位（如后溪、列缺、公孙、照海等）治疗脊柱疾病、生殖问题、运动障碍及内脏失调，并协调阴阳平衡。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>骨空论篇第六十</title>
      <link>http://localhost:62317/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE60%E9%AA%A8%E7%A9%BA%E8%AE%BA%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E5%8D%81/</link>
